seoTitle: Guides — The Solo Trail
seoDescription: Verified local guides for solo trekkers who want expert support without a full tour package. Register your interest.
navActive: guides
pageType: guides
---
{% extends "layouts/base.njk" %}

{% block pagecss %}<link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/guides.css">{% endblock %}

{% block content %}

<section class="guides-hero">
  <div class="eyebrow">Guide marketplace — coming soon</div>
  <h1>Expert support, on your terms</h1>
  <p>Sometimes you want a guide for a tricky section, not for the whole trek. We're building a marketplace for exactly that.</p>
</section>

<div class="guides-main">

  <div class="value-grid">
    <div class="value-card">
      <div class="value-icon">✅</div>
      <h3>Verified locals</h3>
      <p>Every guide is vetted — licensed, English-speaking, and reviewed by solo trekkers like you.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="value-card">
      <div class="value-icon">📅</div>
      <h3>Hire by the day</h3>
      <p>You don't need a guide for the whole trek. Book for a tough section — a high pass, a technical fort climb — and go solo the rest.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="value-card">
      <div class="value-icon">💰</div>
      <h3>Transparent rates</h3>
      <p>Published day rates in local currency. No negotiation, no commission surprises.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="cta-split">
    <div class="cta-card cta-trekker">
      <h2>I'm a solo trekker</h2>
      <p>Get notified when the guide marketplace goes live. Priority access for early waitlist members on Annapurna, Everest, and Maharashtra's technical treks (Kalavantin Durg, AMK, Sandhan Valley).</p>
      <a href="mailto:hello@thesolotrail.com?subject=Guide Marketplace – Trekker Interest&body=I'd like to be notified when the guide marketplace launches." class="btn-trekker">Join trekker waitlist →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="cta-card cta-guide-reg">
      <h2>I'm a local guide</h2>
      <p>Register your interest to be listed. We're onboarding verified guides for ABC, EBC, and Maharashtra's most technical treks first.</p>
      <a href="mailto:hello@thesolotrail.com?subject=Guide Registration Interest&body=I'd like to register as a guide on The Solo Trail." class="btn-guide-reg">Register as a guide →</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="how-section">
    <h2>How it'll work</h2>
    <div class="how-steps">
      <div class="how-step">
        <div class="step-num">1</div>
        <div class="step-body">
          <strong>Browse verified guides by trail and section</strong>
          <span>Filter by language, specialty (altitude sickness, technical scrambling, navigation), and availability.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="how-step">
        <div class="step-num">2</div>
        <div class="step-body">
          <strong>Book by day or section <span class="step-badge">Not group tours</span></strong>
          <span>Hire a guide for day 3 over Thorong La, or just the Nalichi Vaat scramble on Harishchandragad — you decide the scope.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="how-step">
        <div class="step-num">3</div>
        <div class="step-body">
          <strong>Pay securely, leave a verified review</strong>
          <span>Payment held in escrow until your trek day confirms. Review goes back to the community.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>

{% endblock %}
